{"reviewId": "83601884_819ZeeSYf", "review": {"abstract": "如果长波周期从复苏到萧条的运行代表着经济增长的轨迹，那么黄金价格的走势则可以被视为经济增长的反面。以长波衰退期为起点，黄金资产将步入长期牛市，并且在萧条期5～10年的超级行情中获取显著的超额收益。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterUid": 18, "content": "在这一刻，深刻体会了知识就是财富这句话!\n假如几年前看到这本书就好了，不会错过黄金这波。\n现在只能安慰自己，世上没有假如。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "939-1037", "createTime": 1750809756, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "83601884_819ZeeSYf", "userVid": 83601884, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 18, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 83601884, "name": "赵大驰", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0008-OeVvR~7Vp1ypen4ZaQgrOf4/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "赵大驰", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "此人靠阅读拿了四个文理科专业学位♥😁", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "追求知识不是目的，把知识换成财富和幸福生活才是。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-5000", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "书海指明灯", "levelIndex": 5000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 20, "likes": [{"userVid": 298385132, "name": "是谁在敲打我的窗", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0029-DuLXPMKWQorr4fCYeOeakf6/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "是谁在敲打我的窗", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "相信什么便成为什么", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}], "commentsCount": 15, "hotComments": [], "commen